            "value" : "HRV 基線 / 夜間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV 基线偏低，建议优先补恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV baseline is on the low side — prioritize recovery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 基線偏低，建議優先補恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV 基线处在中段，适合留意波动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV baseline is mid-range — keep an eye on fluctuations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 基線處在中段，適合留意波動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV 基线较好，恢复底盘相对稳。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV baseline is good — your recovery foundation is relatively stable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 基線較好，恢復底盤相對穩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV 是心跳间隔变化的参考指标，通常需要结合个人基线、睡眠、活动和当下状态理解。单次高低不能独立代表健康好坏，也不用于医疗诊断。" : {

    },
    "HRV 更像恢复与调节能力的线索，眠屿 会把它和心率一起用于压力参考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV is more of a clue to recovery and regulation capacity; Mianyu combines it with heart rate for your stress reference."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 更像恢復與調節能力的線索，眠屿 會把它和心率一起用於壓力參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV 正在继续走低" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV keeps trending down"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 正在繼續走低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV、静息心率与日常心率三维关系图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3D view of HRV, resting heart rate, and daily heart rate"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV、靜息心率與日常心率三維關係圖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV（心率变异性）通常指相邻心跳间隔的波动情况。一般来说，在休息和恢复良好时 HRV 往往更高；当疲劳、压力、睡眠不足或生病时 HRV 可能降低。\n\n眠屿 会结合 HRV 与心率等指标，给出压力参考值。它不是医疗诊断，仅用于日常自我管理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV (heart rate variability) describes how much the interval between consecutive heartbeats varies. In general, HRV tends to be higher when you're rested and recovering well, and lower when you're fatigued, stressed, sleep-deprived, or unwell.\n\nMianyu combines HRV with heart rate and other metrics to give you a stress reference. It is not a medical diagnosis — it's for everyday self-management only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV（心率變異性）通常指相鄰心跳間隔的波動情況。一般來說，在休息和恢復良好時 HRV 往往更高；當疲勞、壓力、睡眠不足或生病時 HRV 可能降低。\n\n眠屿 會結合 HRV 與心率等指標，給出壓力參考值。它不是醫療診斷，僅用於日常自我管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
