    "iCloud 与 CloudKit 私有同步" : {

    },
    "iCloud 中的孕期记录暂时无法读取，请重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregnancy records in iCloud can't be read right now. Please retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 中的孕期記錄暫時無法讀取，請重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步数据在你关闭对应同步开关后，应用会尽快清理本地缓存；云端已存储的记录需通过删除账号或在 iCloud 设置中手动清理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After you turn off the corresponding sync toggles, the app will promptly clean up local caches; records already stored in the cloud need to be cleaned up by deleting your account or manually in iCloud settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 同步資料在你關閉對應同步開關後，應用會盡快清理本地快取；雲端已儲存的記錄需透過刪除賬號或在 iCloud 設定中手動清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 存储空间不足，释放空间后再试。" : {
