    },
    "iCloud 餐饮记录与睡眠摘要同步默认关闭；药症资料同步默认开启，只上传你确认过的结构化处方、药物和病症，不上传处方原图、OCR 全文、患者身份或 AI 服务元数据。你可以随时关闭药症同步。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud sync for food/drink records and sleep summaries is off by default; medication/condition data sync is on by default and only uploads the structured prescriptions, medications, and conditions you've confirmed — never original prescription images, full OCR text, patient identity, or AI-service metadata. You can turn off medication/condition sync at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 餐飲記錄與睡眠摘要同步預設關閉；藥症資料同步預設開啟，只上傳你確認過的結構化處方、藥物和病症，不上傳處方原圖、OCR 全文、患者身份或 AI 服務後設資料。你可以隨時關閉藥症同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
