    "为保证安全与合规，运维日志（仅含 operation、zone、record type、稳定技术 ID、错误码与耗时）可能保留更长时间，但绝不包含健康数值、文本内容或个人身份信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For security and compliance, operations logs (containing only operation, zone, record type, stable technical IDs, error codes, and timing) may be retained longer, but never contain health values, text content, or personal identity information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為保證安全與合規，運維日誌（僅含 operation、zone、record type、穩定技術 ID、錯誤碼與耗時）可能保留更長時間，但絕不包含健康數值、文字內容或個人身份資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为展示站立、步数、步速、训练、声音与恢复趋势，请允许读取系统健康数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To show standing, steps, walking speed, workouts, sound, and recovery trends, please allow access to system health data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為展示站立、步數、步速、訓練、聲音與恢復趨勢，請允許讀取系統健康資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为提供 AI 问答、天气、订阅验证等功能，你的部分数据可能被传输至中国境外（如美国、新加坡等）的云端服务进行处理。此类传输仅在对应功能需要时发生，且我们会确保接收方提供不低于本政策所承诺的保护标准。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To provide features such as AI Q&A, weather, and subscription verification, some of your data may be transferred to cloud services outside China (such as in the United States or Singapore) for processing. Such transfers occur only when needed for the corresponding feature, and we ensure recipients provide protection standards no lower than those promised in this policy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為提供 AI 問答、天氣、訂閱驗證等功能，你的部分資料可能被傳輸至中國境外（如美國、新加坡等）的雲端服務進行處理。此類傳輸僅在對應功能需要時發生，且我們會確保接收方提供不低於本政策所承諾的保護標準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为提升产品稳定性和用户体验，我们可能收集匿名化的崩溃报告和性能分析数据。这些数据不包含你的健康数值、个人输入文本、账号密码或可精确识别你身份的信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To improve product stability and user experience, we may collect anonymized crash reports and performance analytics. This data does not include your health values, personal input text, account passwords, or information that can precisely identify you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為提升產品穩定性和使用者體驗，我們可能收集匿名化的崩潰報告和效能分析資料。這些資料不包含你的健康數值、個人輸入文字、賬號密碼或可精確識別你身份的資訊。"
