    "优先使用设备和系统提供的健康数据与授权。" : {

    },
    "优先关注睡眠时长和质量" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Focus on sleep duration and quality first"
