    "会尝试读取健康 App 中的周期记录；当前未开启写入权限，本地补充的状态不会写回健康 App。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cycle records from the Health app will be read; write access is off, so locally added status won't be written back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會嘗試讀取健康 App 中的週期記錄；當前未開啟寫入許可權，本地補充的狀態不會寫回健康 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会清空页面派生快照、Widget 展示快照和 Watch 传输缓存，不会删除账号、偏好、目标、Health 原始数据或用户记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This clears derived page snapshots, widget display snapshots, and Watch transfer caches. It won't delete your account, preferences, goals, raw Health data, or user records."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會清空頁面派生快照、Widget 展示快照和 Watch 傳輸快取，不會刪除賬號、偏好、目標、Health 原始資料或使用者記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会移除「%@」下的派生缓存，不会删除账号、偏好、目标或 Health 原始数据。" : {
