      }
    },
    "你可以分别关闭 iCloud 餐饮记录、睡眠摘要和药症资料同步；关闭只停止未来上传，不会自动删除此前已保存到当前 Apple ID 私有数据库的记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can turn off iCloud food/drink record, sleep summary, and medication/condition data sync separately; turning them off only stops future uploads and does not automatically delete records already saved to your current Apple ID's private database."
