          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在使用应用过程中主动输入、上传或分享的内容（如健康备注、AI 对话文本、好友协作内容、反馈信息等）均由你自行负责。你应确保所提交的内容不违反法律法规或侵犯第三方权利。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Content you actively enter, upload, or share while using the app (such as health notes, AI conversation text, collaborative content with friends, and feedback) is your own responsibility. You should ensure that submitted content does not violate laws or infringe third-party rights."
