    "健康分采用报告同源的睡眠、压力、HRV 与活动综合评分。健康样本不足时会单独显示当天的行为记录，但不会把记录数量当作健康分。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The health score combines sleep, stress, HRV, and activity using the same source as reports. When health samples are insufficient, the day's behavior records are shown separately, but record counts are never treated as the health score."
