            "value" : "健康的路上，有好友更精彩！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "健康相关数据可能包括心率、HRV、静息心率、睡眠、步数、活动能量、运动时间、站立时长、呼吸频率、正念分钟、饮水、咖啡因、日照时间、体温、步态与情绪/状态，以及你主动填写或确认的处方、药物、病症、孕期与胎动资料。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Health-related data may include heart rate, HRV, resting heart rate, sleep, steps, active energy, exercise time, stand hours, respiratory rate, mindful minutes, water, caffeine, sunlight time, body temperature, gait, and mood/state, as well as prescriptions, medications, conditions, pregnancy, and fetal-movement details you actively enter or confirm."
