      }
    },
    "先在手表上安装并打开一次 眠屿，后续健康摘要和表盘内容会更稳定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install and open Mianyu on the watch once first — health summaries and watch-face content will be more stable afterward."
