          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理必要且低阻力的事项，减少长时间连续输出，并观察信号是否回稳。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Handle essential, low-friction items first, cut long continuous output, and watch whether signals stabilize."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先處理必要且低阻力的事項，減少長時間連續輸出，並觀察訊號是否回穩。"
          }
        }
      }
