    "先打开健康权限，之后佩戴 Apple Watch 睡觉，这里才会生成睡眠阶段、评分和夜间心率。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enable Health permissions first, then sleep wearing your Apple Watch — only then will sleep stages, scores, and overnight heart rate appear."
          }
