            "value" : "先開啟健康許可權，之後佩戴 Apple Watch 睡覺，這裡才會生成睡眠階段、評分和夜間心率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先扫一眼整体分布，点开单项再看判断依据。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scan the overall picture first, then open a dimension for its evidence."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先掃一眼整體分佈，點開單項再看判斷依據。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把固定会吃的内容排进计划。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start by adding the items you take regularly to your plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把固定會服用的內容排進計畫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把它当作健康线索，再回看最近睡眠、活动和恢复有没有变化。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Treat it as a health clue first, then review whether your recent sleep, activity, and recovery have changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把它當作健康線索，再回看最近睡眠、活動和恢復有沒有變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把它当作恢复线索，而不是单次结果的绝对判断。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Treat it as a recovery clue rather than an absolute judgment from a single result."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把它當作恢復線索，而不是單次結果的絕對判斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把它当作辅助提醒；如果连续异常或伴随不适，请用标准血压计复测并咨询医生。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Treat it as a supplementary reminder; if it's repeatedly abnormal or comes with discomfort, re-measure with a standard monitor and consult a doctor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把它當作輔助提醒；如果連續異常或伴隨不適，請用標準血壓計複測並諮詢醫生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把它放回最近几周的趋势里，再结合睡眠、恢复和活动变化判断这次波动值不值得放大。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put it back into the recent multi-week trend first, then judge whether this fluctuation is worth attention alongside sleep, recovery, and activity changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把它放回最近幾周的趨勢裡，再結合睡眠、恢復和活動變化判斷這次波動值不值得放大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把当天的关键行为和状态节点摆在一起，通常就更容易看懂节律是怎么被推出来的。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lay out the day's key behaviors and status points together first — it's usually easier to see how the rhythm was derived."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把當天的關鍵行為和狀態節點擺在一起，通常就更容易看懂節律是怎麼被推出來的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把恢复放到第一位" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put recovery first"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先把恢復放到第一位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把恢复放回优先级，再继续硬撑会更累" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
