    "删除本机 SwiftData 记录与当前 Apple ID 私有 iCloud 中的对应记录（含好友共享 zone 与公开资料，公开资料为尽力清理）。删除前需二次确认；iCloud 不可用时云端数据会保留并提示重试。此操作不可撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete the local SwiftData record and the corresponding record in the current Apple ID private iCloud(including friends’ shared zones and public data, public data will be cleaned on a best-effort basis). A second confirmation is required before deletion; when iCloud is unavailable, the cloud data will be retained and you will be prompted to try again. This action cannot be undone."
          }
