            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单日层面更像是作息漂移连带活动节律一起在波动。" : {

    },
    "单日层面更像是外部刺激和恢复底盘正在互相影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the single-day level, it looks more like external stimulation and your recovery foundation influencing each other."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單日層面更像是外部刺激和恢復底盤正在互相影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单日峰值" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daily Peak"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單日峰值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单日抬升更像是疲劳或走路姿势的临时影响，先看连续几天的方向。" : {

    },
    "单日波动不等于长期变差" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A single-day fluctuation isn't a long-term decline"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單日波動不等於長期變差"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单日读数更适合放在趋势里看，不必因为某一天抬高就调整节奏。" : {

    },
    "单晚睡眠容易受临时安排、环境和设备采样影响。一周趋势更能体现规律与变化，也更适合指导小行动。" : {

    },
    "单晚结构只用于观察，连续趋势比一次比例更有参考价值" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The single-night structure is only for observation, and the continuous trend has more reference value than the one-time ratio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單晚結構只用於觀察，連續趨勢比一次比例更有參考價值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单次偏高未必代表异常，连续几天波动更值得结合步态与恢复一起看。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A single high reading doesn't necessarily mean an anomaly; several days of fluctuation is worth reviewing together with gait and recovery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單次偏高未必代表異常，連續幾天波動更值得結合步態與恢復一起看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单次平均" : {
