    },
    "只展示真实有效样本，不补假数据。图里会标出 10% 和 15% 的参考线，便于判断波动落在哪个区间。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only real, valid samples are shown — no fake data filled in. The chart marks 10% and 15% reference lines to help judge which range fluctuations fall into."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只展示真實有效樣本，不補假資料。圖裡會標出 10% 和 15% 的參考線，便於判斷波動落在哪個區間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只整理真实记录，不判断因果" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Organizes actual records without inferring causation"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只整理真實記錄，不判斷因果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只要设备厂商能够把数据写入 Apple 健康，眠屿在获得授权后就可以读取支持的数据类型。具体同步能力由设备厂商决定。" : {

    },
    "只记录你主动选择的项目，可随时留空。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the items you choose are recorded; you can leave any of them blank."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只記錄你主動選擇的項目，可隨時留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只记录真实发生的用药与症状；时间重叠用于整理，不代表药物导致症状。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log only medication and symptoms that actually occurred. Time overlap helps organize records and does not mean medication caused a symptom."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只記錄真實發生的用藥與症狀；時間重疊用於整理，不代表藥物導致症狀。"
          }
        }
      }
