    "周期长度是按两次月经开始之间的间隔来计算" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cycle length is measured as the interval between the starts of two periods"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "週期長度是按兩次月經開始之間的間隔來計算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "周期阶段只会影响提醒理由和文案强度，不会额外凭空生成新的提醒种类。经期和黄体期会更偏向“保节律、降刺激、留恢复余量”，把工作密度和收尾节奏再收一点。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cycle phases only affect reminder reasons and wording intensity — they never invent new reminder types. During menstrual and luteal phases, guidance leans toward protecting rhythm, reducing stimulation, and keeping recovery margin, dialing back work density and wind-down pace a bit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "週期階段只會影響提醒理由和文案強度，不會額外憑空生成新的提醒種類。經期和黃體期會更偏向“保節律、降刺激、留恢復餘量”，把工作密度和收尾節奏再收一點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
