    "和上一次记录基本持平，说明当前有氧基础比较稳定。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Roughly level with the last record, meaning your current aerobic base is fairly stable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和上一次記錄基本持平，說明當前有氧基礎比較穩定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和健康 App 一样，把焦虑和抑郁分开做问卷记录。结果按近两周状态生成，更适合按周回看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Like the Health app, anxiety and depression are recorded as separate questionnaires. Results reflect the past two weeks and are best reviewed weekly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "和健康 App 一樣，把焦慮和抑鬱分開做問卷記錄。結果按近兩週狀態生成，更適合按週迴 看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和新睡眠详情页保持同一口径，统一使用四阶段专业时间轴与 0:00、06:00、12:00、18:00 x 轴。" : {
      "localizations" : {
