    },
    "在你主动授权后，将睡眠、心率与活动记录汇成连续趋势；不授权也可以继续使用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After you choose to grant access, sleep, heart rate, and activity records are combined into clear trends. You can continue without granting access."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec votre autorisation, vos données de sommeil, de fréquence cardiaque et d’activité sont regroupées en tendances continues. Vous pouvez continuer sans autoriser l’accès."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "직접 권한을 허용하면 수면, 심박수, 활동 기록을 연속적인 추세로 정리합니다. 권한을 허용하지 않아도 계속 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "После вашего разрешения данные о сне, пульсе и активности объединяются в наглядные тенденции. Приложением можно пользоваться и без предоставления доступа."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你主動授權後，將睡眠、心率與活動記錄整理成連續趨勢；不授權也可以繼續使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在同一模块记录计划、实际用药和身体症状" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log plans, actual medication, and body symptoms in the same module"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一模組記錄計劃、實際用藥和身體症狀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在回落" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falling"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在回落"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在日照、天气或好友共享等场景下，可能会处理当前位置、地点名称或你主动确认共享的粗略位置摘要。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In scenarios such as sunlight, weather, or friend sharing, we may process your current location, place names, or the coarse location summary you confirm to share."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
