    "处方图片会先在设备上提取文字；去除常见身份字段后的文字将发送给阿里云千问进行结构化。原图不会上传，结果保存前可逐项修改。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prescription images have text extracted on-device first; after removing common identity fields, the text is sent to Alibaba Cloud Qwen for structuring. The original image is never uploaded, and every field can be edited before saving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "處方圖片會先在裝置上提取文字；去除常見身份欄位後的文字將傳送給阿里雲千問進行結構化。原圖不會上傳，結果儲存前可逐項修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "处方图片先在设备端提取文字；原图不发送给处方结构化服务，常见身份字段会在发送文字前移除，但你仍应在继续前确认图片不包含不希望云端处理的信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prescription images have text extracted on-device first; the original image is not sent to the prescription structuring service, and common identity fields are removed before text is sent. Still, confirm the image doesn't contain information you don't want processed in the cloud before continuing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "處方圖片先在裝置端提取文字；原圖不傳送給處方結構化服務，常見身份欄位會在傳送文字前移除，但你仍應在繼續前確認圖片不包含不希望雲端處理的資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
