          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果高音量持續較久，可以給自己安排一段安靜恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如需删除 iCloud 中已同步的健康记录，请在应用内关闭对应同步开关，并通过 iCloud 存储管理或联系客服清理云端数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To delete health records synced to iCloud, turn off the corresponding sync toggles in the app, and clean up cloud data via iCloud storage management or by contacting support."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如需刪除 iCloud 中已同步的健康記錄，請在應用內關閉對應同步開關，並透過 iCloud 儲存管理或聯絡客服清理雲端資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "妊娠测试结果" : {
      "localizations" : {
