          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "妊娠測試結果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "孕周、体重与胎动记录用于个人健康管理，不替代产检、诊断或紧急医疗建议。出现胎动明显减少或身体不适时，请及时联系专业医护人员。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gestational week, weight, and fetal movement records are for personal health management and don't replace prenatal checkups, diagnosis, or emergency medical advice. If fetal movement clearly decreases or you feel unwell, contact medical professionals promptly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "孕周、體重與胎動記錄用於個人健康管理，不替代產檢、診斷或緊急醫療建議。出現胎動明顯減少或身體不適時，請及時聯絡專業醫護人員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
