            "value" : "孕期設定、體重與胎動僅使用當前 Apple ID 的 CloudKit 私有資料庫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "孕期设置、孕期体重与胎动时间仅写入当前 Apple ID 的 CloudKit 私有数据库，不写入 眠屿 自有后台；未完成同步的表单内容不会作为成功记录保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregnancy settings, pregnancy weight, and fetal-movement times are written only to the CloudKit private database of your current Apple ID — not to Mianyu's own backend; form content that hasn't finished syncing is not kept as a successful record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
