        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當前壓力較低，是維持身體電量的主要有利因素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前变化速率处在稳定区间。继续保持睡眠和活动节律，更适合按周观察方向，不必放大单日波动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your current rate of change is stable. Maintain your sleep and activity rhythm and review the direction weekly rather than overemphasizing daily fluctuations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前變化速率處於穩定區間。繼續保持睡眠和活動節律，更適合按週觀察方向，不必放大單日波動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前变化速率略快。优先补足睡眠并减少连续高负荷，观察接下来一周是否逐步回到基准线。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your current rate of change is slightly fast. Prioritize sleep and reduce sustained high loads, then see whether it returns toward baseline over the next week."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前變化速率略快。優先補足睡眠並減少連續高負荷，觀察接下來一週是否逐步回到基準線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前只同步到步速摘要，睡眠摘要会在 Health 中有可读记录后补上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
