          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前只获取到睡眠时长，还没有阶段明细。佩戴 Apple Watch 或由健康 App 记录完整睡眠后，这里会展示清醒、快速眼动、核心与深度四阶段的分布与占比。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only sleep duration is available right now — no stage details yet. After you wear an Apple Watch or log full sleep in the Health app, this will show the distribution and share of awake, REM, core, and deep sleep."
