            "value" : "我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们不会把你的健康数据用于与健康管理无关的广告跟踪。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We do not use your health data for advertising tracking unrelated to health management."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們不會把你的健康資料用於與健康管理無關的廣告跟蹤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们仅在实现功能目的、法律法规要求或保障安全所必需的期限内保留你的数据。不同类型数据的保留期不同：本地缓存由你控制；iCloud 数据随你删除账号或关闭同步后清理；必要的运维日志（不含健康内容）通常保留不超过 90 天。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We retain your data only for as long as needed to fulfill functional purposes, comply with laws, or protect security. Retention periods differ by data type: local caches are under your control; iCloud data is cleaned up after you delete your account or disable sync; essential operations logs (excluding health content) are usually retained for no more than 90 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們僅在實現功能目的、法律法規要求或保障安全所必需的期限內保留你的資料。不同型別資料的保留期不同：本地快取由你控制；iCloud 資料隨你刪除賬號或關閉同步後清理；必要的運維日誌（不含健康內容）通常保留不超過 90 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们仅将信息用于提供你主动使用的功能，包括健康趋势分析、睡眠与压力展示、目标与习惯记录、餐食识别、AI 总结、好友共享、设备间同步和订阅管理。除非获得你的额外授权，我们不会将健康数据用于广告画像。" : {

    },
    "我们会处理哪些信息" : {

    },
    "我们会尽量降低中断影响，但无法保证服务始终无错误、无延迟或永久可用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We will try to minimize the impact of interruptions, but cannot guarantee the service is always error-free, latency-free, or permanently available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們會盡量降低中斷影響，但無法保證服務始終無錯誤、無延遲或永久可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们会结合本地存储、App Group、iCloud / CloudKit 与必要的服务端接口来支撑不同能力，并采取合理的技术和管理措施降低未经授权访问、泄露、篡改或丢失的风险。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We support different capabilities with local storage, App Group, iCloud/CloudKit, and necessary server interfaces, and take reasonable technical and administrative measures to reduce the risk of unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or loss."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們會結合本地儲存、App Group、iCloud / CloudKit 與必要的服務端介面來支撐不同能力，並採取合理的技術和管理措施降低未經授權訪問、洩露、篡改或丟失的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们只共享最近 7 天的睡眠、步速摘要、你确认后的粗略位置%@，不包含原始 Health 明细或位置轨迹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We share only the last 7 days of sleep and pace summaries plus a coarse location you confirm%@ — not raw Health details or location tracks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們只共享最近 7 天的睡眠、步速摘要、你確認後的粗略位置%@，不包含原始 Health 明細或位置軌跡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们只共享最近 7 天的睡眠、步速摘要和可选粗略位置%@，不包含原始 Health 明细或位置轨迹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We share only the last 7 days of sleep and pace summaries and an optional coarse location%@ — not raw Health details or location tracks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們只共享最近 7 天的睡眠、步速摘要和可選粗略位置%@，不包含原始 Health 明細或位置軌跡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们可以基于稳定性、安全性、合规或产品规划对功能进行新增、调整、暂停或下线。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We may add, adjust, suspend, or retire features based on stability, security, compliance, or product planning."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們可以基於穩定性、安全性、合規或產品規劃對功能進行新增、調整、暫停或下線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们可能因维护、升级、合规要求、设备兼容性变化、网络问题、第三方依赖故障或不可抗力，导致服务暂时中断、响应延迟或部分能力不可用。我们也可能在合理情况下限制、暂停或终止违规账号的使用权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We may cause temporary interruptions, response delays, or unavailability of some capabilities due to maintenance, upgrades, compliance requirements, device compatibility changes, network issues, third-party dependency failures, or force majeure. We may also restrict, suspend, or terminate the access of accounts that violate the terms, when reasonable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們可能因維護、升級、合規要求、裝置相容性變化、網路問題、第三方依賴故障或不可抗力，導致服務暫時中斷、響應延遲或部分能力不可用。我們也可能在合理情況下限制、暫停或終止違規賬號的使用權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们可能根据产品变化、法律法规或服务安排更新本条款。更新后的版本会在应用内展示，并自展示或注明日期起生效。你继续使用服务，通常视为你已阅读并同意更新后的条款。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We may update these terms based on product changes, laws, or service arrangements. The updated version will be shown in the app and takes effect when displayed or on the date noted. Continuing to use the service is generally taken as having read and agreed to the updated terms."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們可能根據產品變化、法律法規或服務安排更新本條款。更新後的版本會在應用內展示，並自展示或註明日期起生效。你繼續使用服務，通常視為你已閱讀並同意更新後的條款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
