    "整体呼吸频率偏平稳，通常出现在状态更放松或练习完成后的时段。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overall respiratory rate is steady, usually seen when you're more relaxed or after a practice session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
