          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整体时长较完整，但 REM 占比仍有空间。今天可以保持正常节奏，晚上避免过晚进食或高刺激活动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your total sleep duration was solid, but REM sleep still has room to improve. Keep a normal pace today and avoid late meals or highly stimulating activities tonight."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整體時長較完整，但 REM 佔比仍有改善空間。今天可以保持正常節奏，晚上避免太晚進食或高刺激活動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整体曲线离静息心率不远，说明今天多数时段都处在比较轻的身体负荷里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The overall curve stays near resting heart rate, meaning most of today carried a fairly light bodily load."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整體曲線離靜息心率不遠，說明今天多數時段都處在比較輕的身體負荷裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整体睡得还可以，今天注意补足恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overall sleep was fair. Prioritize recovery today."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整體睡得還可以，今天注意補足恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整体睡眠状态不错，再把作息规律性拉齐会更稳。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overall sleep is good — aligning your schedule's regularity would make it steadier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整體睡眠狀態不錯，再把作息規律性拉齊會更穩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整体负担不高，继续留意持续时间和偶发峰值。" : {
