        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mild snoring appeared last night, but overall it looks like localized disturbance. Keep watching whether it coincides with late nights, fatigue, or position changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨夜出現了輕度鼾聲，但整體更像區域性干擾。先繼續觀察是否和晚睡、疲勞或姿勢變化一起出現。"
