        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last night's REM share was within the common healthy range — late-night memory consolidation and emotional recovery went steadily."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨晚 REM 佔比處於常見健康區間，後半夜記憶整理和情緒恢復節奏較平穩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "昨晚 REM 占比较高。如果同时觉得疲惫，可继续结合深睡和夜间觉醒一起看，判断是否只是睡眠结构后移。" : {
