        }
      }
    },
    "昨晚深睡偏少。深睡通常更集中在前半夜，建议优先保证睡眠连续性，并减少晚间酒精、强光和过晚进食。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last night's deep sleep was scant. Deep sleep usually concentrates in the first half of the night — prioritize sleep continuity, and reduce evening alcohol, bright light, and late meals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨晚深睡偏少。深睡通常更集中在前半夜，建議優先保證睡眠連續性，並減少晚間酒精、強光和過晚進食。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "昨晚深睡接近目标。结合时间轴看，如果前半夜频繁切到清醒或核心睡眠，优先优化睡前放松和卧室环境。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last night's deep sleep was near target. Check the timeline: if the first half of the night frequently switched to awake or core sleep, optimize pre-sleep relaxation and the bedroom environment first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨晚深睡接近目標。結合時間軸看，如果前半夜頻繁切到清醒或核心睡眠，優先最佳化睡前放鬆和臥室環境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "昨晚深睡达到常见目标区间，前半夜修复节奏比较完整，身体恢复基础不错。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
