    "晚上优先早点收尾、少刺激、少额外训练，尽量把睡前节奏放缓。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tonight, wrap up early, cut stimulation and extra training, and slow the pre-sleep pace as much as possible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "晚上優先早點收尾、少刺激、少額外訓練，儘量把睡前節奏放緩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "晚上保持温和节奏就好，别临时加高强度训练或太晚工作。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
