            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just keep a gentle pace tonight — no last-minute high-intensity training or working too late."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "晚上保持溫和節奏就好，別臨時加高強度訓練或太晚工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "晚上可以做轻到中等活动，但仍建议把结束时间留在睡前 2 小时之外。" : {
