    "月度会员为自动续订订阅，确认购买后将通过 Apple ID 扣款；除非在当前订阅期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则会自动续订。购买后可在 App Store 账号订阅设置中管理或取消。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The monthly membership is an auto-renewing subscription charged to your Apple ID upon purchase confirmation; it renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. After purchase, manage or cancel it in your App Store account's subscription settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月度會員為自動續訂訂閱，確認購買後將透過 Apple ID 扣款；除非在當前訂閱期結束前至少 24 小時取消，否則會自動續訂。購買後可在 App Store 賬號訂閱設定中管理或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
