    "本应用主要面向一般成年人及在监护人指导下使用的未成年人。我们不主动收集 13 岁以下儿童的个人信息。如发现误收集，我们将尽快删除。我们可能根据产品能力、法律法规或合规要求更新本政策，更新后会在应用内展示最新版本。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This app is mainly intended for adults and minors who use it under a guardian's guidance. We do not actively collect personal information from children under 13. If we discover we have collected it by mistake, we will delete it promptly. We may update this policy based on product capabilities, laws, or compliance requirements; the latest version will be shown in the app after updates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本應用主要面向一般成年人及在監護人指導下使用的未成年人。我們不主動收集 13 歲以下兒童的個人資訊。如發現誤收集，我們將盡快刪除。我們可能根據產品能力、法律法規或合規要求更新本政策，更新後會在應用內展示最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用可能接入 Apple 登录、Apple Health、StoreKit、iCloud / CloudKit、定位、天气服务、云端 AI 服务或应用后端。你使用这些能力时，还应同时遵守对应第三方平台的条款、隐私政策和系统规则。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app may integrate Apple Sign-In, Apple Health, StoreKit, iCloud/CloudKit, location, weather services, cloud AI services, or an app backend. When you use these capabilities, you should also comply with the corresponding third-party platform's terms, privacy policies, and system rules."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本應用可能接入 Apple 登入、Apple Health、StoreKit、iCloud / CloudKit、定位、天氣服務、雲端 AI 服務或應用後端。你使用這些能力時，還應同時遵守對應第三方平臺的條款、隱私政策和系統規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本提醒基于当前健康指标的波动生成，不替代医疗诊断。请结合身体感受判断。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This alert is generated from fluctuations in current health metrics and doesn't replace medical diagnosis. Judge together with how your body feels."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本提醒基於當前健康指標的波動生成，不替代醫療診斷。請結合身體感受判斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本政策用于说明 眠屿 在你使用应用、账号能力、AI 健康助手、好友共享与协作功能时，如何处理与你相关的信息。不同功能依赖的数据类型和存储位置可能不同，我们会尽量按“本地优先、最少必要”的原则处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This policy explains how Mianyu handles information related to you when you use the app, account features, the AI health assistant, friend sharing, and collaboration. Different features may rely on different data types and storage locations; we try to follow the principles of \"local-first and minimal necessity.\""
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本政策用於說明 眠屿 在你使用應用、賬號能力、AI 健康助手、好友共享與協作功能時，如何處理與你相關的資訊。不同功能依賴的資料型別和儲存位置可能不同，我們會盡量按“本地優先、最少必要”的原則處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本政策说明 眠屿 如何在健康分析、账号能力、AI 问答、好友共享与订阅相关流程中收集、使用、存储和保护你的信息，以及你所享有的隐私权利。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This policy explains how Mianyu collects, uses, stores, and protects your information in health analysis, account features, AI Q&A, friend sharing, and subscription processes, as well as the privacy rights you have."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本政策說明 眠屿 如何在健康分析、賬號能力、AI 問答、好友共享與訂閱相關流程中收集、使用、儲存和保護你的資訊，以及你所享有的隱私權利。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
