    },
    "此操作只撤销你发出的共享；不会删除本机健康数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only revokes the sharing you initiated; it won't delete health data on this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作只撤銷你發出的共享；不會刪除本機健康資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此档案只整理你输入的名称、剂量、用途、备注和体感，不包含权威适应症、禁忌、相互作用或个体化用法。核对药品信息时，请以药品说明书、处方和医生或药师意见为准。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This profile only organizes the names, doses, purposes, notes, and feelings you entered — it doesn't include authoritative indications, contraindications, interactions, or individualized usage. When verifying medication info, rely on the drug label, prescription, and your doctor's or pharmacist's advice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此檔案只整理你輸入的名稱、劑量、用途、備註和體感，不包含權威適應症、禁忌、相互作用或個體化用法。核對藥品資訊時，請以藥品說明書、處方和醫生或藥師意見為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此设备不提供 Apple Health 数据能力（例如部分模拟器或不支持 HealthKit 的设备）。请在 iPhone 真机上使用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
