            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步態不對稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步态不对称 %@ %@，%@，%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "步态不对称 %1$@ %2$@，%3$@，%4$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步态不对称会读取本地健康样本并按真实有效日绘制趋势；没有记录时不会补零，避免把空白误当成改善。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gait asymmetry reads local health samples and plots trends over real valid days; missing days aren't zero-filled, so blanks aren't mistaken for improvement."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步態不對稱會讀取本地健康樣本並按真實有效日繪製趨勢；沒有記錄時不會補零，避免把空白誤當成改善。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步态不对称反映左右步伐是否平衡，先看趋势，再判断是否需要继续留意。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gait asymmetry reflects whether left and right steps are balanced — look at the trend first, then decide whether it needs continued attention."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步態不對稱反映左右步伐是否平衡，先看趨勢，再判斷是否需要繼續留意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步态不对称反映左右迈步时间差，10% 以内常见；步态平稳度反映走路是否稳；两条信号连续几天同向偏移时，才值得提高关注。" : {

    },
