    "疑似房颤线索 %lld 次（含心律不齐通知与 ECG 房颤结论），房颤可能增加卒中风险，建议就医评估。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suspected atrial fibrillation clues %lld times (including irregular heartbeat notification and ECG atrial fibrillation conclusion), atrial fibrillation may increase the risk of stroke, and it is recommended to seek medical evaluation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疑似房顫線索 %lld 次（含心律不齊通知與 ECG 房顫結論），房顫可能增加卒中風險，建議就醫評估。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "疑似语音" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
