    "系统会先根据你的睡眠、恢复、久坐、自然光和咖啡因上下文，帮你判断今天更适合推进、重置、保护还是收尾。只有你明确开启后，这些提醒才会真正参与本地通知编排。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on your sleep, recovery, sedentary time, natural light, and caffeine context, the system first judges whether today suits pushing forward, resetting, protecting, or winding down. Only after you explicitly enable them do these reminders actually join local notification scheduling."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統會先根據你的睡眠、恢復、久坐、自然光和咖啡因上下文，幫你判斷今天更適合推進、重置、保護還是收尾。只有你明確開啟後，這些提醒才會真正參與本地通知編排。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
