    "终身会员为一次性购买，不会自动续订。确认购买后将通过 Apple ID 扣款，权益用于解锁 眠屿 Pro 的 iOS 功能。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lifetime membership is a one-time purchase and does not auto-renew. After confirming, your Apple ID will be charged, and the entitlement unlocks Mianyu Pro's iOS features."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "終身會員為一次性購買，不會自動續訂。確認購買後將透過 Apple ID 扣款，權益用於解鎖 眠屿 Pro 的 iOS 功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "经典" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
