    "虚线表示两项指标各自的区间均值，绿色线表示线性趋势。相关性只描述同步变化，不代表因果或医学诊断。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dashed lines show each metric's range average; the green line shows the linear trend. Correlation only describes synchronized change — not causation or a medical diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虛線表示兩項指標各自的區間均值，綠色線表示線性趨勢。相關性只描述同步變化，不代表因果或醫學診斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "虚线表示区间均值，实线表示线性趋势。相关性只描述同步变化，不代表因果或医学诊断。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dashed lines show the range average, solid lines the linear trend. Correlation describes co-movement only, not causation or medical diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虛線表示區間均值，實線表示線性趨勢。相關性只描述同步變化，不代表因果或醫學診斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
