    },
    "请确保您的 Apple Watch 已连接至 iPhone，且在 iPhone 的「Watch」应用中开启了通知权限。同时，请检查手表的「勿扰模式」或「睡眠模式」是否处于关闭状态。\n\n如问题仍未解决，请尝试重启手表并重新授权健康数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make sure your Apple Watch is connected to your iPhone and that notification permissions are enabled in the Watch app on your iPhone. Also check that Do Not Disturb or Sleep mode on the watch is turned off.\n\nIf the problem persists, try restarting the watch and re-authorizing Health data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
