    "近两周低落和功能受影响已经比较明显，建议尽快联系专业支持，并认真看待休息和陪伴需求。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Low mood and impaired functioning have been notable over the past two weeks — contact professional support soon, and take rest and companionship needs seriously."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "近兩週低落和功能受影響已經比較明顯，建議儘快聯絡專業支援，並認真看待休息和陪伴需求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近两周低落和疲惫感已经偏重，适合尽快补充支持，而不是只靠自己硬扛。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Low mood and fatigue have been heavy over the past two weeks — add support soon rather than toughing it out alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "近兩週低落和疲憊感已經偏重，適合儘快補充支援，而不是隻靠自己硬扛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近两周焦虑困扰已经比较明显，建议把作息、咖啡因和高压时段一起回看，必要时尽快寻求专业支持。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anxiety has been notable over the past two weeks — review your schedule, caffeine, and high-stress periods together, and seek professional support soon if needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "近兩週焦慮困擾已經比較明顯，建議把作息、咖啡因和高壓時段一起回看，必要時儘快尋求專業支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近两周焦虑波动不算轻，可以继续连续观察，并给自己留出更稳定的恢复窗口。" : {
      "localizations" : {
