    },
    "鼾声在整夜多次出现与中断，节律变化较大。" : {

    },
    "鼾声片段会按发生时段归类到睡眠阶段，各阶段加权计算总分。分数越低，通常代表整夜更安静。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Snoring clips are grouped into sleep stages by when they occur, and each stage is weighted into the total score. A lower score usually means a quieter night."
